@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title 图 17 设计级顺序图：场景执行（F5 步骤树 + 过程回显）

actor "用户" as U
participant "场景编辑器\n(展示层)" as FE
participant "API" as API
participant "ModeRunner\n(控制层)" as MR
participant "PolicyEngine" as P
participant "CommandHandler" as CH
participant "Store" as S
participant "Broadcaster" as BC

U -> FE : 点击「回家」
FE -> API : POST /api/modes/{id}/run
API -> MR : Start(modeId, user)
MR -> S : 读 mode.definition（步骤树）
MR -> S : insert run(status="running")
MR --> FE : runId
FE -> FE : 打开执行时间线

loop 按序取节点
  alt ActionStep
    MR -> P : Execute(intent from step)
    P --> MR : 指令
    MR -> CH : Handle(cmd)
    CH --> MR : ok / error
  else DelayStep
    MR -> MR : 等待 seconds
  else ChooseStep
    MR -> MR : 求值守卫
    MR -> MR : 选 then / else 子树
  end
  MR -> S : upsert run_step(status)
  MR -> BC : Broadcast(执行进度)
  BC --> FE : {runId, nodeId, status}
end

MR -> S : update run(status="done")
MR -> BC : Broadcast(run 结束)
BC --> FE : 时间线全部标绿

note right of MR
  单步失败默认中止整个 run，
  并把它之前已成功的步骤保持原样；
  失败原因写入 run_step.error。
end note
@enduml
